Subject: [PATCH 06/12] Play audio from URLs the book already resolved

Kolibri rewrites data-audio-src, data-backgroundaudio and the activity sound attributes to blob: or zipcontent URLs, so prefixing them with the book folder makes an unfetchable URL.
